 that, I'll have a look myself later when I've got a minute, no need to dig into it now.\", \"Oh, one more thing about her, when was the last time we actually spoke? I feel like it's been ages.\"], [\"who am I seeing at the shutter?\", \"scrap that, I'll check later\", \"when'd we last speak?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0050\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you show me the… the an hour and a half jobs on my list?\", \"ok and how many of those are, uh, still open?\", \"ahh actually scrap that, I'll just check it myself later\", \"oh and um, different thing, can you find the Prouris entries in my calendar?\", \"hmm what about in my notes, anything there?\"], [\"which jobs on my list take an hour and a half\", \"how many of those r still open\", \"eh scrap that ill check later myself\", \"diff thing, find the Prouris entries on my calendar pls\", \"what about in my notes\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0051\", \"v\": [[\"so what time is the, uh, the shutter thing?\", \"oh, um, actually don't bother, it's fine\", \"ok different question, which group is the fiddle top-up expense in?\", \"and uh, what have I got on while I'm away in Jalhaven?\"], [\"what time's the shutter thing\", \"actually dont bother\", \"which group is the fiddle top-up expense in\", \"also what have i got on while im away in Jalhaven\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0052\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how many tasks I have due next week, please?\", \"I'm trying to plan out how busy things are going to get, so could you tell me how many tasks I've got due next week?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0053\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please log that Neville and I grabbed a coffee?\", \"It was Neville Mokoena, please.\", \"Also, would you mind jotting down a note that says gift ideas for Minh?\"], [\"hey so um, Neville and I grabbed a coffee, can you log that?\", \"oh the, uh, Neville Mokoena one\", \"oh and can you jot down a note that says, um, gift ideas for Minh\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0054\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when Maija's birthday is, please?\", \"I want to get a card sorted in plenty of time this year, so when is Maija's birthday again?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0055\", \"v\": [[\"I've got a feeling it's coming up soon but I've lost track, when's my coffee with Maija actually happening?\", \"And who else is coming along to that? Just want to know who I'll be seeing there.\", \"Oh, I've been meaning to send something over to Kofi, could you grab me Kofi's email?\", \"Ah, actually scrap that, I'll sort it out and check myself later on, don't worry about it.\"], [\"when's coffee with Maija?\", \"who's coming?\", \"Kofi's email?\", \"scrap that, I'll check later\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0057\", \"v\": [[\"does Maija Underhill owe me anythng\", \"and Oona Flamwick?\"], [\"Maija Underhill owe me?\", \"and Oona Flamwick?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0058\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me where the candelabra draft went, please?\", \"Thank you. Would you mind showing me the other notes in that same notebook?\"], [\"I was working on something last month and now I can't find it anywhere, where did the candelabra draft end up?\", \"Ah good, and since I'm clearing things up, could you show me whatever else is sitting in that same notebook with it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0059\", \"v\": [[\"how many pics this month?\", \"pull up the draughts session thing\", \"nah, leave it\"], [\"Could you tell me how many photos I've taken this month?\", \"Also, would you please pull up the draughts session thing?\", \"Actually, no thank you, please leave it.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w12-0060\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me which photos I've taken this month, please?\", \"umm can you show me which, uh, which pictures I took this month?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0001\", \"v\": [[\"cashew thing when?\", \"latest pic?\", \"task: reply to the garden photo wednesday\", \"which album's it in?\"], [\"Could you tell me when my cashew thing is, please?\", \"Different question: what's the most recent picture I've taken?\", \"Would you please add a task to reply to the garden photo on wednesday?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me which album that photo is in?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0002\", \"v\": [[\"umm when's my, uh, my peppermint thing?\", \"peppermint thing when?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0003\", \"v\": [[\"ok so can you find my, uh, unpack tasks?\", \"oh and um, which task is roughly an hour job?\", \"hey so, uh, Somchai and I had coffee, can you log that?\", \"oh the, um, the Arbuthnot one\", \"ok and uh, what do I still have to get done this week?\"], [\"Could you please find the unpack tasks for me?\", \"Separately, could you tell me which task is roughly an hour of work?\", \"Also, would you mind logging that I had coffee with Somchai?\", \"It was Somchai Arbuthnot, please.\", \"One more thing: could you tell me what I still have to get done this week?\"]]}","ttft_ms":10652,"type":"result","duration_ms":27698,"uuid":"c17f2b9a-0f4a-4261-83a6-67ff30694c6c","ttft_stream_ms":1341,"time_to_request_ms":113,"first_content_frame_ms":1341,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22032687,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278583277.5977,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
